        "Follow-ups rewritten into standalone questions first"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Routing + construction",
      "items": [
        "Logical: LLM picks vectorstore / relational DB / graph DB",
        "Semantic: closest prompt by embedding similarity",
        "Text-to-SQL, Text-to-Cypher, self-query metadata filter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Indexing",
      "items": [
        "Tables and CSVs are loaded into the relational DB",
        "LLM-extracted triples are written to the graph DB",
        "Child chunks are searched; their parents come from the docstore"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Retrieval",
      "items": [
        "Re-rank: cross-encoder, Cohere, RankGPT or ColBERT",
        "CRAG drops irrelevant docs; too few → rewrite and search again + web"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Generation",
      "items": [
        "Answers cite numbered passages",
        "Self-RAG: regenerate if ungrounded, re-retrieve if off-topic"
      ]
    }
